            "text": "<p><strong>Presale </strong>☎️<strong>Hotline: +1(281)777-8190</strong></p><p><strong>Calling Open Time: PST 9:00AM-3:00PM(Mon-Fri)</strong></p><p><strong>Contact Email: service@wellfittreadmill.com<br/><br/>1-5Day Fast delivery, shipped from 7 warehouses in California, Georgia, Texas, New Jersey, Houston and, New York</strong></p>"
