        "title": "Spec&Size",
        "content": "<p>This compact treadmill fits in tight spaces and offers an ideal exercise solution for those with limited home space. it can be easily moved and placed under the bed, under the locker when not in use; Controlled with a remote, its 3 HP motor features a whisper-quiet brusehless motor, and can easily be adjusted to meet a variety of fitness goals.</p>",
